.TH "INSPEKT\-OPEN" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-open \- Navigate to a URL in the browser with full JavaScript
execution.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]open\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]] \f[I]URL\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Navigate to a URL in the browser with full JavaScript execution.
.PP
Use this instead of HTTP fetch when you need:
.IP \(bu 2
Dynamic content rendered by JavaScript
.IP \(bu 2
Authentication state from browser cookies
.IP \(bu 2
Interaction with the page after loading
.PP
Supports wait conditions for reliable page loading.
.SH ALIASES
Also available as: \f[B]inspekt nav\f[R], \f[B]inspekt goto\f[R].
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\f[I]URL\f[R]
required text argument
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\(enwait\f[R]
Wait for page to finish loading
.TP
\f[B]\-t\f[R], \f[B]\(entimeout\f[R], \f[I]INTEGER\f[R]
Timeout in seconds when using \(enwait (default: 30)
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt open https://example.com
inspekt open https://example.com \-\-wait load
inspekt open \(dqhttps://example.com\(dq
.EE
